# Important Project Files

These files define the core structure and behavior of this MCP server project. They should be included in every chat for context.

## Configuration

- `package.json` — Project metadata, scripts (`build`, `dev`), dependencies, and bin entry point
- `tsconfig.json` — TypeScript compiler configuration
- `pnpm-lock.yaml` — Locked dependency versions
- `pnpm-workspace.yaml` — pnpm workspace settings (esbuild build approval)

## Source

- `src/main.ts` — MCP server entry point with SSE transport
- `src/tools/index.ts` — Registers all MCP tools with the server
- `src/tools/issues.ts` — MCP tools for GitHub issues
- `src/tools/pull-requests.ts` — MCP tools for GitHub pull requests
- `src/github-functions/client.ts` — Shared Octokit client instance
- `src/github-functions/types.ts` — Shared types for GitHub API calls
- `src/github-functions/issues.ts` — Octokit wrapper functions for issues
- `src/github-functions/pull-requests.ts` — Octokit wrapper functions for pull requests

## Environment

- `.env` — GitHub personal access token (`GITHUB_TOKEN`); not committed to git
- `.env.example` — Template for required environment variables

## Cursor Rules

- `.cursor/rules/important-files.mdc` — This file; lists important project files

## Other

- `.gitignore` — Ignores `node_modules`, `dist`, and `.env`

---

When adding new important files to this project (e.g. new source modules, config files, or rules), update this `important-files.mdc` file to include them.
